put one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua is a student who loves plants, and he plants some rare flowers in the school garden. Zhao Min loves photography very much, and she takes pictures of these flowers when she passes by the school garden. Zhang Wei sees Zhao Min taking pictures of the flowers without permission, but because he knows Zhao Min has a difficult family situation and photography is her only hobby, he does not stop her. When Li Hua finds out that someone takes pictures of his flowers and posts them on social media without permission, he starts asking people around him. In the end, Zhao Min finds out that the flowers belong to Li Hua and admits her behavior.\n\n[Question]\nWhat is the possible intention of Zhang Wei's behavior?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei possibly chooses not to interfere with her behavior because of Zhao Min's love for photography.\nB. Zhang Wei possibly chooses not to interfere with her behavior out of sympathy and understanding.\nC. Zhang Wei hopes to help Zhao Min post the pictures of the flowers on social media, so he chooses not to interfere with her behavior.\nD. Zhang Wei possibly fears that Zhao Min is upset because she is prevented from taking pictures, so he chooses not to interfere with her behavior.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a9fc2ddb05a7fe2e845","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452127381,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"con